# Design system (DESIGN.md)

Before generating or changing visual UI:

1. Read root `DESIGN.md` (one Design 2 pack).
2. Open [`refs/design-2/DESIGN.md`](refs/design-2/DESIGN.md) and [`refs/design-2/wireframes.md`](refs/design-2/wireframes.md), then `docs/mvp/04-UI-Design-Goals.md` and `.cursor/rules/frontend/` for product UX.

- Design 2 is locked (cream `page` canvas, warm-white `canvas` cards, black primary pill, pastel status fills, Bricolage Grotesque + Manrope). Owner routes use `OwnerShell` (black sidebar `md+`, black bottom tabs on phone). Busy badge stays 🟢/🟡/🔴; pastels are owner status only. `refs/design-1` is history; do not keep a second live pack.
- Product UX still comes from `docs/mvp/` and `.cursor/rules/frontend/`.
